# Mailbox AI directory

When you add, rename, or remove a user-facing AI feature (OpenAI/`/api/ai/*`, `/api/search-nl`, `/api/recommend`, game hints, etc.):

1. Update `src/lib/ai/directory.ts` (`AI_DIRECTORY`) with label, blurb, and href.
2. Mailbox **AI tools** reads that list automatically — do not hardcode entries in `mailbox-panel.tsx`.
3. Prefer a short seed mail item in `mailbox-data.ts` when the feature is newly shipped.
4. Book recommendations must include Add to TBR where books are listed.
